      "message": "[error] Line 205: 🔴 The full metadata snapshot is serialized into a single `SyncMsg`, while the metadata store accepts up to 4 MiB and this sync transport uses a 16-bit message-size limit. Valid metadata larger than the transport limit therefore cannot be synchronized (and a wrapped/truncated length can break framing). Fragment the metadata with authenticated reassembly, or enforce the actual transport limit before accepting/storing values.",
      "revId": "1d3a1dd54bf08d92099fa2c06c6f13be0bea5da7",
